{
  "id": "debt_vs_equity",
  "title": "債務融資 vs 股權融資：風險與回報的博弈",
  "resolution": "720x1280",
  "characters": {
    "A": {
      "name": "燈",
      "role": "questioner",
      "color": "#FFD54F"
    },
    "B": {
      "name": "派大星",
      "role": "explainer",
      "color": "#4FC3F7"
    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "熊大我最近發現一個矛盾的事",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0001_B.mp3",
      "start": 0.1,
      "end": 3.748
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "什麼樣的矛盾",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0002_A.mp3",
      "start": 3.868,
      "end": 5.692
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "借錢給公司跟買公司股票",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0003_B.mp3",
      "start": 5.812,
      "end": 9.724
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "最壞情況都是虧光本金",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0004_B.mp3",
      "start": 9.844,
      "end": 13.54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "蛤，那不是差不多嗎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0005_A.mp3",
      "start": 13.66,
      "end": 16.132
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "但所有人都說股票風險高得多",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0006_B.mp3",
      "start": 16.252,
      "end": 20.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "這不是自相矛盾嗎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0007_A.mp3",
      "start": 20.5,
      "end": 22.636
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "一點也不，這正好揭示風險的本質",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0008_B.mp3",
      "start": 22.756,
      "end": 27.196
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "我們先從公司的角度來看",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0009_B.mp3",
      "start": 27.316,
      "end": 30.748
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "公司籌資有兩條路",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0010_B.mp3",
      "start": 30.868,
      "end": 33.892
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "借錢還是找人合夥",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0011_A.mp3",
      "start": 34.012,
      "end": 36.34
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "就是債務融資和股權融資",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0012_B.mp3",
      "start": 36.46,
      "end": 40.516
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "英文叫Debt Financing和Equity Financing",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0013_B.mp3",
      "start": 40.636,
      "end": 44.812
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "一個借錢一個入股嘛",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0014_A.mp3",
      "start": 44.932,
      "end": 47.524
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，先說資本成本",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0015_B.mp3",
      "start": 47.644,
      "end": 52.036,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "資本成本",
          "en": "Cost of Capital"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "哪個比較便宜",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0016_A.mp3",
      "start": 52.156,
      "end": 54.028
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債務比股權便宜，有三個原因",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0017_B.mp3",
      "start": 54.148,
      "end": 58.132
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第一，優先受償權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0018_B.mp3",
      "start": 58.252,
      "end": 63.004,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "優先受償權",
          "en": "Priority in Liquidation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "公司破產清算時，債權人排前面",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0019_B.mp3",
      "start": 63.124,
      "end": 67.684
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以債權人風險低，要的利息也低",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0020_A.mp3",
      "start": 67.804,
      "end": 71.668
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，就像排隊領錢，排越前面越安心",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0021_B.mp3",
      "start": 71.788,
      "end": 76.684
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第二，利息有稅盾效應",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0022_B.mp3",
      "start": 76.804,
      "end": 81.268,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "稅盾效應",
          "en": "Tax Shield"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "稅盾是什麼意思",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0023_A.mp3",
      "start": 81.388,
      "end": 83.404
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "利息能在稅前扣除，等於政府幫你分擔",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0024_B.mp3",
      "start": 83.524,
      "end": 88.468
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "股利是稅後分配的，沒這個好處",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0025_B.mp3",
      "start": 88.588,
      "end": 92.812
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "稅後債務成本等於稅前利率乘一減稅率",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0026_B.mp3",
      "start": 92.932,
      "end": 98.356
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以利息越高省稅越多",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0027_A.mp3",
      "start": 98.476,
      "end": 101.236
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第三，債權人缺乏上行收益",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0028_B.mp3",
      "start": 101.356,
      "end": 106.108,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "上行收益",
          "en": "Upside"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "公司賺再多，債權人也只拿固定利息",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0029_A.mp3",
      "start": 106.228,
      "end": 110.092
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "沒錯，但股東可以享受無限上行",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0030_B.mp3",
      "start": 110.212,
      "end": 114.508
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "所以股東要求更高的回報溢價",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0031_B.mp3",
      "start": 114.628,
      "end": 120.004,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "回報溢價",
          "en": "Risk Premium"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那什麼時候該選債務什麼時候選股權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0032_A.mp3",
      "start": 120.124,
      "end": 123.7
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "關鍵看未來業績特徵",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0033_B.mp3",
      "start": 123.82,
      "end": 127.036
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "現金流可預測就選債務",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0034_B.mp3",
      "start": 127.156,
      "end": 131.98,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "可預測",
          "en": "Predictable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像電力公司收入穩定，按時付息沒問題",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0035_B.mp3",
      "start": 132.1,
      "end": 137.164
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "不可預測的呢",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0036_A.mp3",
      "start": 137.284,
      "end": 139.06
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "選股權，固定利息可能壓垮公司",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0037_B.mp3",
      "start": 139.18,
      "end": 143.788
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像生技新創研發週期長，不確定性高",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0038_B.mp3",
      "start": 143.908,
      "end": 148.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以成熟企業愛借錢，新創愛發股",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0039_A.mp3",
      "start": 148.948,
      "end": 152.836
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "精闢，這也牽涉財務槓桿",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0040_B.mp3",
      "start": 152.956,
      "end": 157.612,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "財務槓桿",
          "en": "Leverage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債務增加槓桿，放大盈虧",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0041_B.mp3",
      "start": 157.732,
      "end": 161.548
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "雙面刃的意思",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0042_A.mp3",
      "start": 161.668,
      "end": 163.564
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，現在換到投資人的視角",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0043_B.mp3",
      "start": 163.684,
      "end": 167.668
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權投資和股權投資有六個維度差異",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0044_B.mp3",
      "start": 167.788,
      "end": 172.828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "哪六個維度",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0045_A.mp3",
      "start": 172.948,
      "end": 174.724
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "資本期限、利益請求權、最大損失",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0046_B.mp3",
      "start": 174.844,
      "end": 179.404
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "回報潛力、投資風險、投票權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0047_B.mp3",
      "start": 179.524,
      "end": 184.036
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "一個一個來吧",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0048_A.mp3",
      "start": 184.156,
      "end": 185.932
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第一，資本期限",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0049_B.mp3",
      "start": 186.052,
      "end": 189.988,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "資本期限",
          "en": "Capital Tenor"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權有限，有明確到期日",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0050_B.mp3",
      "start": 190.108,
      "end": 193.996
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "股權無限，公司活著就永遠存在",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0051_B.mp3",
      "start": 194.116,
      "end": 198.58
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以股票沒有到期日",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0052_A.mp3",
      "start": 198.7,
      "end": 201.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第二，利益請求權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0053_B.mp3",
      "start": 201.508,
      "end": 205.228,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "利益請求權",
          "en": "Interests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權人優先且固定，股東是剩餘請求權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0054_B.mp3",
      "start": 205.348,
      "end": 210.772
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "剩餘就是最後才輪到",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0055_A.mp3",
      "start": 210.892,
      "end": 213.316
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，付完所有人之後才分給股東",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0056_B.mp3",
      "start": 213.436,
      "end": 217.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第三，最大損失，兩者竟然相同",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0057_B.mp3",
      "start": 218.068,
      "end": 222.868
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "都是虧光本金",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0058_A.mp3",
      "start": 222.988,
      "end": 224.884
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "沒錯，這就是開頭說的矛盾",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0059_B.mp3",
      "start": 225.004,
      "end": 228.892
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第四，回報潛力",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0060_B.mp3",
      "start": 229.012,
      "end": 233.284,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "回報潛力",
          "en": "Return Potential"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權有上限，股權無上限",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0061_B.mp3",
      "start": 233.404,
      "end": 237.316
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "公司賺十倍，債權人還是只拿利息",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0062_A.mp3",
      "start": 237.436,
      "end": 241.084
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第五，投資風險",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0063_B.mp3",
      "start": 241.204,
      "end": 245.236,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "投資風險",
          "en": "Investment Risk"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權較低，股權較高",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0064_B.mp3",
      "start": 245.356,
      "end": 248.836
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "等等，最大損失一樣，為何風險不同",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0065_A.mp3",
      "start": 248.956,
      "end": 252.676
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "好問題，風險不只看最大損失金額",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0066_B.mp3",
      "start": 252.796,
      "end": 257.404
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "更看損失的機率和波動性",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0067_B.mp3",
      "start": 257.524,
      "end": 262.036,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "波動性",
          "en": "Volatility"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權人有優先償付權，虧損機率低",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0068_B.mp3",
      "start": 262.156,
      "end": 266.788
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "股東是剩餘索取權，公司倒可能分文不得",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0069_B.mp3",
      "start": 266.908,
      "end": 271.9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "而且股價波動遠大於債券",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0070_B.mp3",
      "start": 272.02,
      "end": 275.908
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以風險是機率加波動性",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0071_A.mp3",
      "start": 276.028,
      "end": 278.98
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "第六，投票權",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0072_B.mp3",
      "start": 279.1,
      "end": 283.06,
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "投票權",
          "en": "Voting Rights"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "債權人無投票權，股東有",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0073_B.mp3",
      "start": 283.18,
      "end": 287.092
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以股東能參與公司決策",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0074_A.mp3",
      "start": 287.212,
      "end": 290.236
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，這也是CFA考試的重要考點",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0075_B.mp3",
      "start": 290.356,
      "end": 294.916
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以發行人和投資人是鏡像關係",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0076_A.mp3",
      "start": 295.036,
      "end": 298.708
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "沒錯，一個降成本，一個擔風險換回報",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0077_B.mp3",
      "start": 298.828,
      "end": 303.964
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "說到底，融資就是風險和回報的博弈",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_debt_vs_equity_line0078_A.mp3",
      "start": 304.084,
      "end": 307.804
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "下次我們來聊WACC和資本結構",
